  "name": "Animate Google Drive photos into Hailuo videos for TikTok, Reels and YouTube Shorts",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "82d9c3f8-f29a-42a7-aafa-b6e0b06607b1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -620,
        -97
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 833,
        "content": "## Turn photos in a Google Drive folder into short videos and post them\nDrop photos in a Google Drive folder and get short videos on TikTok, Instagram Reels and YouTube Shorts: Gemini plans the motion and captions, MiniMax Hailuo animates the photo and PostWire posts it.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every 2 hours** finds the photos in the folder and **Take the next photo** picks one. **Move to the Animated folder** claims it, so a photo is never animated twice.\n2. **Write the captions with Gemini** looks at the photo and writes the motion prompt, a caption per network and the YouTube title.\n3. **Hailuo image to video** (MiniMax) animates the photo and waits until the clip is ready.\n4. **Post to TikTok, Reels and Shorts** (PostWire) uploads the clip and publishes it with each caption.\n5. **Log the video** adds the links to a Google Sheets log. If the render or a network fails, **Log the fix** and **Email me the fix** say what to fix.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified **PostWire** node (search \"PostWire\" in the nodes panel), create an account at postwire.io, connect your networks and paste your API key into a **PostWire API** credential.\n2. Add a Google Gemini credential and a MiniMax credential (video is billed per clip).\n3. Create two Drive folders, To animate and Animated, and pick them in **Find new photos** and **Move to the Animated folder**. Vertical photos give vertical videos.\n4. Create a sheet with the columns photo, file_link, status, posted_at, links and note, and pick it in both log nodes. Connect Gmail and fill in **Video settings**.\n\n### Customize\nChange the style in Video settings, the length in the Hailuo node or the networks in the PostWire node (the free plan posts to 2 networks per post)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
